sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as worker W: write doc d as identity i
    participant A as worker A: revoke i's relationship on d
    participant R as regolith

    W->>R: ACP check in this transaction: point reads and scan_validated of the tuples granting i on d
    R-->>W: tuple present: allowed
    W->>R: merge(d, part operand)
    A->>R: delete the tuple
    A->>R: commit
    R-->>A: committed: i is revoked
    W->>R: commit
    Note over R: the tuple the decision rested on changed
    R-->>W: Conflict: mine Read or ScannedRange, theirs Delete on the ACP tuple
    W->>R: transact re-runs with the reason
    W->>R: ACP check: tuple absent
    Note over W: business logic: deny, a write never commits after a revocation it raced
